##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
version 3.03
Display "camera-dof.tif" "file" "rgba"
Projection "perspective" "fov" 45
PixelSamples 3 3
Format 400 300 1
DepthOfField 2 1 5

Translate 0 0 5
Rotate -110 1 0 0
Rotate 70 0 0 1

WorldBegin
   Color 0 1 0
   Cone 1.5 0.75 360

   Color 1 0 0
   Translate -4 0 0
   Cone 1.5 1 360

   Color 0 0 1
   Translate 7 1 0
   Cone 1.5 0.25 360
WorldEnd
